{"id":"16-3035-2-2","zh":"以 ha 结尾的词根","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3036-2-4","zh":"araha，用于“供养”义。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3036-5-8","zh":"araheti、arahayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3036-9-12","zh":"arahā、arahaṃ（阿罗汉）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3036-13-25","zh":"“arahā（阿罗汉）、khīṇāsavo（漏尽者）、asekkho（无学者）”，这些都是阿罗汉的名称。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3037-2-4","zh":"sineha，用于“爱着”义。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-3037-5-8","zh":"sineheti、sinehayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3038-2-4","zh":"varaha，用于“伤害”义。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3038-5-8","zh":"varaheti、varahayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3038-9-10","zh":"varāho。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3039-2-7","zh":"**varāho** 既可以指野猪，也可以指大象。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3039-8-48","zh":"在“羚羊与野猪（varāhā）”这句里，野猪被称为“varāho”；而在“大 varāha……在河中保持警醒”这句里，则是大象被称为“varāho”。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3040-2-4","zh":"raha，用于“舍弃”义。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3040-5-8","zh":"raheti、rahayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3041-2-4","zh":"caha，用于“夸耀”义。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3041-5-8","zh":"caheti、cahayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3042-2-4","zh":"maha，用于“供养”义。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3042-5-8","zh":"maheti、mahayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3042-9-12","zh":"mahito（受尊崇的）、rājā（国王）、mahārājā（大王）。","confidence":70}
{"id":"16-3042-13-16","zh":"vihāramaho（寺院庆典）、cetiyamaho（塔庙庆典）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-3043-2-4","zh":"piha，用于“希求”义。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3043-5-8","zh":"piheti、pihayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3043-9-17","zh":"pihā（希求）、pihālu（好希求的人）、apiho（无所希求的人）、pihanīyā vibhūtiyo（令人羡慕的荣华）。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3044-2-5","zh":"kuha，用于“使人惊奇”义。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-3044-6-9","zh":"kuheti、kuhayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3044-10-11","zh":"kuhako（诡诈者）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-3044-12-16","zh":"他 kuhayati，也就是做出让世人惊奇的事，所以叫作 kuhako。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3044-17-18","zh":"kuhanā（诡诈）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-3045-2-4","zh":"saha，用于“忍受”义。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3045-5-7","zh":"“忍受”就是忍耐。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3045-8-11","zh":"saheti、sahayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3045-12-13","zh":"sahanaṃ（忍受）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3045-14-24","zh":"不过，它作为 bhū 等类的词根时，形式是“sahati”。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-3046-2-4","zh":"garaha，用于“责备”义。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3046-5-8","zh":"garaheti、garahayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3046-9-10","zh":"garahā（责备）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3046-11-21","zh":"不过，它作为 bhū 等类的词根时，形式是“garahati”。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-3047-2-4","zh":"以上是以 ha 结尾的词根的变化形式。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3048-2-2","zh":"以 ḷa 结尾的词根","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3049-2-4","zh":"taḷa，用于“敲打”义。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3049-5-8","zh":"tāḷeti、tāḷayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3049-9-12","zh":"patāḷeti、patāḷayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3049-13-14","zh":"tāḷaṃ。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3049-15-18","zh":"tāḷaṃ 指铜钹之类的乐器。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3050-2-4","zh":"taḷa，用于“打击”义。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-3050-5-8","zh":"变化形式与前面相同。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-3051-2-4","zh":"khaḷa，用于“分裂”义。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3051-5-8","zh":"khaḷeti、khaḷayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3052-2-4","zh":"iḷa，用于“赞叹”义。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3052-5-8","zh":"iḷeti、iḷayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3053-2-4","zh":"juḷa，用于“推动”义。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3053-5-8","zh":"joḷeti、joḷayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3054-2-4","zh":"pīḷa，用于“压入”义。","confidence":60}
{"id":"16-3054-5-8","zh":"pīḷeti、pīḷayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3054-9-12","zh":"nippīḷeti、nippīḷayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3054-13-22","zh":"pīḷanako（压迫者）、pīḷito（受压迫的）、pīḷā（逼迫）、pīḷanaṃ（压迫）、nippīḷanako（挤压者）。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3055-2-4","zh":"laḷa，用于“亲近”义。","confidence":70}
{"id":"16-3055-5-8","zh":"lāḷeti、lāḷayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3055-9-12","zh":"upalāḷeti、upalāḷayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3055-13-26","zh":"不过，这个词根属于 bhū 等类、表示“嬉戏”义时，形式是“laḷati”。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3056-2-4","zh":"siḷa，用于“欢呼”义。","confidence":65}
{"id":"16-3056-5-8","zh":"seḷeti、seḷayati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"16-3056-9-10","zh":"seḷento（欢呼着）。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3056-11-16","zh":"这里的 **seḷeti** 是指发出欢呼的声音。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3057-2-4","zh":"以上是以非组辅音结尾的词根的变化形式。","confidence":70}
{"id":"16-3058-2-10","zh":"我尽自己的能力，所见到的 cur 等类词根就是这些；","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-3059-2-7","zh":"其余的，也请你们在经典中查考，按照意义是否相合来采用。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3060-2-7","zh":"以 cura 为首的这一类词根，我是为了教法而宣说的，","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-3061-2-6","zh":"希求丰富利益的智者，也应当学习它；","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3062-2-6","zh":"因为在导师那方法丰富的圣典中学习它，","confidence":65}
{"id":"16-3063-2-6","zh":"就能得到如甘露般可爱的义理精华。","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3064-2-7","zh":"以上，在为了让智者通晓连同义注在内的九分教、三藏中的语言之道","confidence":75}
{"id":"16-3065-2-4","zh":"而撰写的《声义论》（Saddanīti）中，","confidence":70}
{"id":"16-3066-2-6","zh":"阐明 cur 等类词根的第十八章。","confidence":85}
